  "_about": "Torchlight's live design tokens (dark theme, the only theme the app renders: <html class=\"dark\"> in src/app/layout.tsx). Source of truth is src/app/globals.css; this file is a snapshot of it. Hex values are the .dark block resolved (aliases followed), under the CSS's own names (--ember is \"ember\", --bg-base is \"bg-base\"), so they also match the Tailwind classes (bg-card, text-muted-foreground, bg-bg-raised). The two colours at the end of the colour map, input-on-card and destructive-10-on-card, are not CSS tokens: they are --input (15% tint) and --destructive (10%) blended over --card, which the contrast script needs as plain hex. Mapping to replica role names: bg=background, surface=card, text=foreground, text-muted=muted-foreground, accent=primary, on-accent=primary-foreground, danger=destructive. Values follow the Figma theme (Playground, collection Theme, mode Dark) adopted on 2026-10-28; see docs/plano-redesign-ficha.md. Machine-readable DTCG copy with aliases and descriptions: docs/design-tokens/design-tokens.json. Check with: python3 replica/design/contrast.py replica/design/tokens.json",
